SDUSD::pause
├── when caller is not a configured pauser for the pause type
│   ├── when attempting to pause
│   │   └── it should revert with Unauthorized
│   └── when attempting to unpause
│       └── it should revert with Unauthorized before checking owner-only unpause authorization
├── when caller is a configured non-owner pauser
│   ├── when pausing an unpaused pause type
│   │   ├── it should set the pause type to paused
│   │   └── it should emit Paused
│   ├── when pausing an already paused pause type
│   │   └── it should revert with StateNotChanged
│   ├── when attempting to unpause a paused pause type
│   │   └── it should revert with SDUSDUnauthorized
│   └── when attempting to set an unpaused pause type to unpaused
│       └── it should revert with SDUSDUnauthorized before checking state change
└── when caller is the owner and a configured pauser
    ├── when pausing an unpaused pause type
    │   ├── it should set the pause type to paused
    │   └── it should emit Paused
    ├── when unpausing a paused pause type
    │   ├── it should set the pause type to unpaused
    │   └── it should emit Paused
    └── when setting the current pause state again
        └── it should revert with StateNotChanged
